  "script": {
    "hook": "Bhai, seedha baat karta hoon — React ab ek library hai, framework nahi. Aur Next.js ne uski gaadi cheen li hai.",
    "body": "Dekho, 2024 Stack Overflow survey mein Next.js top 3 most-loved frameworks mein hai. React? Sirf ek tool reh gaya hai jiske upar Next.js bana hai. Pehle hum React mein routing khud likhte the, state manage karte the, SEO ke liye jugaad lagate the — Next.js ne yeh sab out-of-the-box de diya. Netflix, TikTok, Twitch — sab Next.js pe hain. Pure React apps production mein rarely milte hain ab. Aur dekho job boards — 'Next.js Developer' postings pichle ek saal mein 40% badhein hain. React seekhna zaroori hai, but woh sirf foundation hai. Ghar banane ke liye Next.js chahiye. React dead nahi hai — but alone use karna? That's the real mistake.",
    "cta": "Comment karo — tum pure React use karte ho ya Next.js pe shift ho gaye? Aur is video ko us dost ko bhejo jo abhi bhi React mein jugaad laga raha hai. Follow karo CodeOrCap — Stop Guessing. Start Knowing.",
